title: "Epidemiological suite"
abstract: >-
  Sample size, power and analysis tools for community medicine, epidemiology and clinical research: calculators for about
  160 study designs, each with its formula, a worked example and a citable source. Available as a web application and as
  the R package epidemiologysuite.
